# 15 - Animation: a bouncing ball (and a trail of colors)

make window app titled "Bouncing Ball" sized 620 by 480
add canvas box to app sized 600 by 400 background "night"
draw circle on box at 300, 200 size 22 color "orange" called ball
add label info to app saying "Click the canvas to change the color"

set dx to 5
set dy to 3.5
set bounces to 0

every 16 milliseconds do step
when mouse is clicked on box do recolor_ball

make task step
    move ball by dx, dy
    bounce ball inside box using dx, dy
    if ball touches "edge" then
        add 1 to bounces
        set text of info to "Bounces: {bounces}"
    end
    if bounces is more than 0 and bounces mod 5 is 0 then
        draw dot on box at x of ball, y of ball size 2 color "white"
    end
end

make task recolor_ball with x, y
    set color of ball to random_color()
end
